A small number of policies in a market could mean either:

The market genuinely has a small policy inventory;

Only a subset of policies is currently onboarded into GPPS;

The table is partially populated;

The market is still undergoing rollout;

Some policy types are maintained elsewhere.

Therefore, policy count should not automatically be interpreted as the
